WEBVTT

01:31.520 --> 01:34.800
BEFORE XIE HUAI'AN ENTERS CHANG'AN

02:00.080 --> 02:01.160
I have lost.

02:02.120 --> 02:03.280
Then please, Han,

02:03.800 --> 02:06.080
return the way you came as we agreed.

02:07.000 --> 02:08.160
On this matter,

02:08.680 --> 02:11.440
forgive me, but I must go back on my word.

02:12.720 --> 02:16.960
Do you know why His Majesty
has summoned you?

02:17.040 --> 02:18.000
Yes,

02:19.320 --> 02:20.560
and that's exactly why

02:21.440 --> 02:22.760
I must go.

02:23.280 --> 02:24.960
If you wish to save Xiao Wenjing,

02:25.560 --> 02:27.080
you should not go.

02:29.200 --> 02:30.680
If you do not believe me,

02:30.760 --> 02:32.280
let's wager once more.

02:33.560 --> 02:35.800
I will find someone
and disguise him as you

02:36.440 --> 02:37.680
to meet the Emperor in your place.

02:38.360 --> 02:41.280
If he dies, I win,

02:41.880 --> 02:45.240
and you will do one thing for me.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.400
But how will that man

02:48.600 --> 02:50.320
know what I am supposed to say?

02:51.160 --> 02:52.640
He won't need to say anything,

02:53.320 --> 02:54.800
because the Emperor won't ask.

02:55.760 --> 02:58.040
The moment Han Ziling meets the Emperor

02:59.040 --> 03:00.840
will already be the time of his death.

03:11.760 --> 03:12.960
FLATBREAD WITH SOUP

03:13.040 --> 03:14.520
How did you know

03:15.320 --> 03:18.640
I would die after seeing His Majesty?

03:20.040 --> 03:23.040
Because I knew
what His Majesty intended to do,

03:24.120 --> 03:25.440
and I knew

03:25.960 --> 03:27.560
you were recommended by Gu Yu.

03:28.160 --> 03:29.720
General Gu has always been loyal.

03:31.440 --> 03:33.120
Did His Majesty suspect him of treachery?

03:33.200 --> 03:35.000
His Majesty knew

03:35.520 --> 03:37.040
Gu Yu was a good man.

03:37.800 --> 03:39.280
And for that very reason,

03:39.360 --> 03:40.680
he knew anyone Gu Yu recommended

03:40.760 --> 03:43.000
would never harm the deposed emperor.

03:44.120 --> 03:45.040
Killing you

03:46.000 --> 03:47.560
was to warn Gu Yu

03:48.240 --> 03:49.960
not to interfere.

03:51.560 --> 03:53.760
Better to settle it early

03:54.280 --> 03:56.920
than fall out
with the Gu family afterward.

03:59.800 --> 04:02.680
Who was the man dying in my place?

04:03.440 --> 04:04.600
A wanted criminal.

04:05.120 --> 04:07.000
I promised to give his family

04:07.080 --> 04:10.200
1,000 liang of gold
if he agreed to do this.

04:10.280 --> 04:12.560
So it seems, Xie,

04:13.760 --> 04:15.160
you are not a good man.

04:22.680 --> 04:24.080
A good man can help neither you

04:25.000 --> 04:26.800
nor the one you wish to save.

04:29.720 --> 04:30.880
What do you want me to do?

04:31.720 --> 04:33.600
Infiltrate a place for me.

04:36.240 --> 04:37.760
Hidden Soldier Alley.

05:07.320 --> 05:09.120
-Dump it in the back.
-All right.

05:56.800 --> 05:59.080
I also prepared a gift for you.

05:59.160 --> 06:00.040
You'll like it.

06:02.520 --> 06:03.400
I am sorry, Di.

06:04.760 --> 06:05.960
I must rescue Gu Yu.

06:27.880 --> 06:30.280
WINE

06:34.400 --> 06:36.000
He kept staring at me just now.

06:40.800 --> 06:43.840
He just realized
you and I were working together.

06:44.360 --> 06:46.280
He checked my travel passes and wounds,

06:46.920 --> 06:48.360
but our planning

06:48.440 --> 06:50.560
left him with no reason to suspect me.

06:53.880 --> 06:55.440
He truly took you as a friend.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.840
Yet I was your undercover agent.

06:59.040 --> 07:00.000
Because of an accident,

07:00.840 --> 07:03.120
his death became inevitable.

07:04.440 --> 07:05.680
Scheming…

07:06.200 --> 07:08.200
Both you and I know how to do it.

07:09.280 --> 07:10.600
But in the end,

07:12.040 --> 07:13.600
it is still a blade going in white

07:14.880 --> 07:15.720
and coming out red.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.320
But you did nothing wrong.

07:20.880 --> 07:22.040
If you had hesitated,

07:23.480 --> 07:24.760
the ones buried underground

07:26.680 --> 07:27.960
would be you and me.

07:29.440 --> 07:30.360
I know.

07:31.040 --> 07:34.440
Whether I liked him had little to do
with whether I should kill him.

07:35.280 --> 07:36.640
In the end,

07:38.160 --> 07:40.480
people only kill to save themselves.

07:44.200 --> 07:46.760
Di Lu
was well-liked in Hidden Soldier Alley.

07:46.840 --> 07:48.640
His death won't stay hidden for long.

07:49.400 --> 07:50.680
We need to match our accounts.

08:07.240 --> 08:09.880
This house faces north and is always damp.

08:11.080 --> 08:13.080
The smell of wine will
linger for more than ten days.

08:13.800 --> 08:16.160
It can cover the smell
of the corpse for a while.

08:16.760 --> 08:17.960
Invited by Di Lu,

08:18.480 --> 08:20.520
you and I went to try
his homemade pine needle wine.

08:21.400 --> 08:23.360
We entered his home
in the first half of the Xu hour.

08:23.440 --> 08:24.920
We drank, talked, and enjoyed ourselves.

08:25.000 --> 08:26.600
We even got a bit carried away

08:26.680 --> 08:28.320
and accidentally knocked over a few jars.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.560
We left before the Hai hour.

08:31.520 --> 08:32.440
After returning home,

08:32.520 --> 08:34.760
you had a hangover headache
and stayed in bed,

08:35.360 --> 08:37.400
while I was busy writing travel passes.

08:38.000 --> 08:39.240
When we saw each other again,

08:39.760 --> 08:41.080
two or three days had passed.

08:41.679 --> 08:44.960
And from that day on,
neither of us ever saw Di Lu again.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.400
Who is it?

10:35.480 --> 10:37.120
Me, Li Sangeng.

10:38.040 --> 10:38.880
What is it?

10:38.960 --> 10:41.720
Mr. Li Mingtai needs a travel pass,

10:41.800 --> 10:43.600
but he is ill and bedridden,

10:44.120 --> 10:46.080
so he sent me on his behalf.

10:58.680 --> 11:00.520
Please prepare a travel pass for him.

11:01.760 --> 11:03.840
It's a hot day. Come in for some tea.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.880
Everyone, take a break.

11:08.440 --> 11:09.760
-All right.
-All right.

11:22.520 --> 11:24.200
Li Mingtai is bedridden?

11:24.280 --> 11:25.200
Was that your doing?

11:26.320 --> 11:28.760
I needed a proper excuse to visit you,

11:29.280 --> 11:31.440
so I treated him to
some questionable buns.

11:33.400 --> 11:35.240
These past few days, I walked every lane.

11:35.320 --> 11:37.760
So far, I've heard no talk of Di Lu.

11:37.840 --> 11:39.800
He often took commissions
and disappeared for days.

11:39.880 --> 11:42.600
A short absence may not raise suspicion.

11:46.440 --> 11:48.040
A few more days and the lie won't hold.

11:49.840 --> 11:53.200
Tell me, what have you learned?

11:58.480 --> 12:00.800
Before I came, you told me

12:00.880 --> 12:03.160
Hidden Soldier Alley was a concept,

12:03.240 --> 12:05.040
not just a single alley.

12:05.560 --> 12:07.080
So after I entered the alley,

12:07.160 --> 12:10.640
the first thing I did
was confirm its full layout.

12:11.520 --> 12:13.160
Here in Yanzuo Ward,

12:13.240 --> 12:16.160
from south to north is 450 bu,

12:16.680 --> 12:19.440
and from west to east is 650 bu.

12:19.520 --> 12:21.240
Within this entire area,

12:21.320 --> 12:23.400
everything except the outermost ring

12:23.480 --> 12:25.800
is Hidden Soldier Alley.

12:27.080 --> 12:28.480
The outermost ring

12:29.000 --> 12:30.600
is where common people live,

12:31.280 --> 12:34.320
meaning it offers the best cover.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.480
And in danger,

12:37.000 --> 12:38.480
the best hostages.

12:40.760 --> 12:42.880
Now look at the row houses
on the west side.

12:42.960 --> 12:44.560
They look densely packed,

12:44.640 --> 12:46.840
but they produce
very little trash each day.

12:46.920 --> 12:48.800
That means the fewest soldiers
are hidden there,

12:49.320 --> 12:50.480
and the defense is thinnest.

12:51.640 --> 12:52.680
So where are the troops kept?

12:53.360 --> 12:55.160
The northwest and the southeast.

12:55.240 --> 12:57.920
Both areas have many soldiers.

12:58.000 --> 12:59.760
Avoid them when you move.

13:00.280 --> 13:02.160
Even on ordinary days,
go around them if you can.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.360
Any leads

13:04.120 --> 13:04.960
on Gu Yu?

13:06.160 --> 13:07.000
None needed.

13:07.080 --> 13:09.040
Almost everyone knows where he is.

13:09.680 --> 13:10.960
Capturing Gu Yu

13:11.040 --> 13:12.960
is quite a feat for Wang Pu.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.200
That night, I saw it with my own eyes.

13:15.280 --> 13:18.440
Wang Pu, with two Huben guards,
dragged Gu Yu

13:18.520 --> 13:19.600
through the streets and alleys

13:19.680 --> 13:22.320
into the Zuihua Tower by the market.

13:37.960 --> 13:38.920
What is it?

13:39.560 --> 13:41.360
Do you know General Gu personally?

13:43.480 --> 13:45.280
For me, my family, and the realm,

13:46.080 --> 13:47.000
Gu Yu

13:48.360 --> 13:49.720
is someone I can't afford to lose.

13:51.760 --> 13:53.440
I want to take a look

13:54.240 --> 13:55.640
around the Zuihua Tower by the market.

13:55.720 --> 13:58.440
Deliver Li Mingtai's travel pass yourself.

13:59.120 --> 14:01.160
He lives in one of the row houses
on the second floor.

14:01.680 --> 14:03.240
When the window opens, it faces

14:03.840 --> 14:06.360
directly toward
the Zuihua Tower by the market.

14:06.440 --> 14:10.200
Why else
do you think I treated him to those buns?

14:45.840 --> 14:46.680
Who is it?

14:47.200 --> 14:48.920
Wang Xing. I've brought your travel pass.

14:49.520 --> 14:52.040
I feel terrible and can't get out of bed.

14:52.760 --> 14:55.520
Slide it through the door.

14:56.520 --> 14:58.160
TRAVEL PASS

15:01.960 --> 15:03.120
Thank you.

15:03.200 --> 15:04.440
You are welcome.

15:17.720 --> 15:21.200
ZUIHUA TOWER

16:04.400 --> 16:06.640
General, please wipe your face.

16:13.560 --> 16:14.840
What is it, General?

16:14.920 --> 16:17.120
Have I done something wrong?

16:21.040 --> 16:24.520
How many people did Wang Pu pass over

16:25.160 --> 16:26.480
before choosing you?

16:27.760 --> 16:29.040
As far as I know,

16:29.560 --> 16:31.320
around 30 people.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.680
General, look at me.

16:37.040 --> 16:38.520
Do I resemble your former attendant?

16:39.720 --> 16:40.760
Former?

16:41.520 --> 16:43.400
I am your attendant now,

16:43.920 --> 16:45.160
and I will remain so.

16:45.240 --> 16:47.920
You may be staying here
for quite some time.

16:48.000 --> 16:50.280
As for the girl named Wumei,

16:51.200 --> 16:52.960
she belongs to your past.

16:55.840 --> 16:57.800
Mr. Wang Pu said

16:58.320 --> 17:00.440
he wanted you to feel at home.

17:01.600 --> 17:02.520
Is that so?

17:08.240 --> 17:11.960
Wumei always did whatever I asked.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.000
I can do that too,

17:21.119 --> 17:23.200
perhaps even better.

17:24.480 --> 17:25.480
Aside from

17:26.119 --> 17:28.760
letting you leave this place,

17:31.680 --> 17:33.400
I can do whatever else

17:34.680 --> 17:36.600
you need.

17:50.960 --> 17:52.880
Then bring me a small carving knife

17:53.920 --> 17:57.520
and a piece
of white camphor wood I can carve.

18:00.240 --> 18:03.840
If I am really going to stay here
for a long time,

18:05.000 --> 18:06.720
I need something

18:07.640 --> 18:10.200
to pass the time.

18:13.320 --> 18:16.920
You said you would do whatever I asked.

18:17.800 --> 18:19.000
Surely

18:19.800 --> 18:21.720
a simple carving knife
isn't beyond your reach, is it?

18:24.840 --> 18:26.080
Of course not.

18:26.800 --> 18:27.640
Go, then.

18:46.120 --> 18:47.240
What did you get out of him?

18:47.760 --> 18:48.960
He wouldn't say a word.

18:56.160 --> 18:57.760
The Baiwenhu Army is well-trained.

18:59.320 --> 19:01.560
It is hard to make them betray each other.

19:02.360 --> 19:03.240
Open it.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.280
How many of you came in?

19:16.600 --> 19:17.720
Say one name,

19:18.320 --> 19:19.960
and you can trade his life for yours.

19:20.640 --> 19:22.080
You'll walk free,
and he'll suffer in your place.

19:29.840 --> 19:30.880
Then again,

19:31.640 --> 19:32.680
you are like brothers.

19:33.200 --> 19:34.720
How could you betray one another?

19:37.640 --> 19:38.480
How about this?

19:41.680 --> 19:43.360
Say one name,

19:46.000 --> 19:47.200
and both you and he walk free.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.560
What do you say?

19:55.240 --> 19:57.440
Your partners are on my turf.

19:57.520 --> 19:58.880
Sooner or later, I'll find them.

20:00.600 --> 20:02.320
But if I can help save one, I will.

20:03.480 --> 20:04.400
I, Wang Pu,

20:05.080 --> 20:07.560
am a man of my word.

20:24.840 --> 20:27.040
Is my offer not good enough?

20:27.840 --> 20:29.920
Not even one word?

20:32.040 --> 20:33.520
How impolite.

21:47.800 --> 21:49.280
So you are not mute after all.

21:57.160 --> 21:59.120
The regional commanders
are entering the Capital.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.400
I must go pay them a visit.

22:01.880 --> 22:03.120
There must still be

22:03.200 --> 22:05.040
some of their men
hidden in Hidden Soldier Alley.

22:07.480 --> 22:08.720
To save Gu Yu,

22:09.240 --> 22:11.560
they will try anything.

22:14.120 --> 22:15.160
Watch

22:17.440 --> 22:18.640
everything closely.

22:18.720 --> 22:19.840
Yes, sir.

23:11.240 --> 23:13.720
Covering your face
only makes you more suspicious.

23:13.800 --> 23:16.800
Could you endure this work
without covering your face?

23:19.280 --> 23:22.040
Thank you for putting up with all this.

23:22.880 --> 23:24.920
A Baiwenhu soldier
was just burned to death.

23:25.000 --> 23:26.320
He must have come to rescue Gu Yu.

23:29.000 --> 23:31.040
The Baiwenhu soldiers who slipped in
have been exposed?

23:31.680 --> 23:33.800
If you can reach the remaining ones,

23:33.880 --> 23:35.200
tell them to be very careful.

23:35.880 --> 23:36.720
Also,

23:37.880 --> 23:40.000
you and I must be careful too.

23:40.080 --> 23:42.280
-Take care.
-Take care.

24:25.240 --> 24:27.280
This thing is fine, isn't it?

24:29.080 --> 24:30.200
A couple of days ago,

24:31.040 --> 24:34.000
Di Lu came to ask me for a few of these.

24:34.080 --> 24:37.880
He said he'd had
a misunderstanding with the new guy

24:38.800 --> 24:41.240
and wanted to
give him these as an apology.

24:41.320 --> 24:43.520
Then he vanished.

24:46.040 --> 24:48.480
You were the last person to see him.

24:48.560 --> 24:49.440
Tell me,

24:49.960 --> 24:51.360
where did he go?

25:04.600 --> 25:05.440
He's dead.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.440
His body

25:09.000 --> 25:11.200
is buried under the wine jars
in his house.

25:14.160 --> 25:15.800
White Hair,

25:15.880 --> 25:17.880
if you hadn't dyed your hair white,

25:17.960 --> 25:20.000
I wouldn't have recognized you.

25:21.240 --> 25:23.240
Since you know who I am,

25:24.240 --> 25:25.480
you should know

25:27.200 --> 25:29.080
I am here for revenge.

25:32.240 --> 25:33.760
No one who deserves death

25:34.560 --> 25:36.360
will escape me.

25:38.600 --> 25:41.200
Aren't you afraid
you'll fall into my hands?

25:41.280 --> 25:43.640
I won't spare you either.

25:49.040 --> 25:50.640
Of course I'm not afraid.

25:50.720 --> 25:52.640
There's someone locked up

25:53.320 --> 25:54.640
in the Imperial Guard prison.

25:56.480 --> 25:58.600
I wonder how he is now.

26:00.320 --> 26:01.920
Before I came here,

26:02.960 --> 26:04.120
I took

26:05.360 --> 26:06.320
a gold coin from him.

26:22.200 --> 26:23.440
To the Huben Army,

26:24.840 --> 26:27.600
Qingyi is nothing
more than an expendable pawn.

26:28.200 --> 26:29.920
And expendable pawns

26:30.720 --> 26:32.280
should be tossed away,

26:33.080 --> 26:34.920
just like Liu Ziyan.

26:36.400 --> 26:39.640
But to me, he is still useful.

26:41.600 --> 26:44.800
If nothing happens to me,
nothing will happen to him.

26:45.320 --> 26:47.280
If something happens to me,

26:47.360 --> 26:49.240
he won't even have a body left to bury.

26:49.960 --> 26:50.880
His fate

26:51.720 --> 26:53.000
is in your hands.

26:54.800 --> 26:56.640
Yes, he's my disciple.

26:57.160 --> 26:58.560
So what?

26:58.640 --> 27:00.520
The rules of the Huben Army

27:00.600 --> 27:02.560
come above all else.

27:07.840 --> 27:09.520
You are right about that.

27:10.360 --> 27:12.120
But if you truly believed that,

27:14.520 --> 27:16.680
you would have reported me to Wang Pu

27:17.200 --> 27:19.040
the moment you sensed something was wrong,

27:19.120 --> 27:21.200
instead of waiting here,

27:22.040 --> 27:22.880
fearing I had a plan.

27:23.760 --> 27:26.840
Rules are rigid. People are flexible.

27:27.680 --> 27:29.480
I know the bond between you and Qingyi

27:29.560 --> 27:31.320
goes beyond master and disciple.

27:31.840 --> 27:33.320
Many years ago,

27:34.200 --> 27:36.120
your only child died young.

27:36.200 --> 27:37.720
A few years later,

27:37.800 --> 27:39.480
you found Qingyi

27:39.560 --> 27:41.800
eating offerings at your child's grave,

27:42.320 --> 27:44.680
and you took him in
as a gift sent from above.

27:45.880 --> 27:46.840
You don't want

27:47.560 --> 27:51.960
your second child
to die like this, do you?

27:54.800 --> 27:56.880
All you need to do is keep silent

27:57.560 --> 28:00.080
and let me stay hidden
in Hidden Soldier Alley.

28:01.360 --> 28:02.720
Once I leave,

28:03.640 --> 28:04.800
your second child

28:06.440 --> 28:08.680
will return to you unharmed.

28:10.800 --> 28:12.400
He once schemed against you,

28:12.480 --> 28:16.080
and he has done his share
of deeds for the Huben Army.

28:16.680 --> 28:18.000
Will you really spare him?

28:22.960 --> 28:24.800
I will leave no enemy alive.

28:26.000 --> 28:27.600
But I still have

28:28.360 --> 28:30.160
some humanity left.

28:38.560 --> 28:39.680
Aunt Xin.

28:49.320 --> 28:53.320
You were one of my father's
earliest subordinates.

28:54.720 --> 28:58.280
I still remember that bond.

29:00.480 --> 29:01.440
All right.

29:02.520 --> 29:03.400
You should go.

29:31.320 --> 29:35.880
You don't want your second child
to die like this, do you?

29:36.480 --> 29:38.240
All you need to do is keep silent

29:39.000 --> 29:41.400
and let me stay
hidden in Hidden Soldier Alley.

29:42.560 --> 29:43.960
Once I leave,

29:44.960 --> 29:46.120
your second child

29:47.720 --> 29:49.800
will return to you unharmed.

30:11.200 --> 30:14.160
GRAVE OF LIU ZIQI, BELOVED SON

30:21.680 --> 30:23.480
Beat me or scold me,
but let me finish eating.

30:30.880 --> 30:32.760
I come up the mountain every three days

30:33.520 --> 30:35.040
to leave some flatbread and fruit here.

30:35.560 --> 30:36.760
You can come eat.

30:48.280 --> 30:49.400
Who is he to you?

30:53.360 --> 30:54.440
He was my child.

30:55.600 --> 30:57.400
When he passed, he was about your age.

30:58.960 --> 31:00.440
Can you teach me how to survive?

31:00.960 --> 31:02.720
I can't eat grave offerings forever.

31:06.360 --> 31:07.480
All I know is how to kill.

31:08.560 --> 31:09.920
This path leads nowhere good.

31:11.560 --> 31:13.640
I killed the leader of the opera troupe
and escaped.

31:14.800 --> 31:16.000
I'm already on this path.

31:57.800 --> 32:01.280
I never dare walk past this place
too fast,

32:01.360 --> 32:03.160
afraid you'll mistake me for an assassin

32:04.000 --> 32:05.360
and kill me.

32:06.280 --> 32:08.520
I rarely strike without reason.

32:09.480 --> 32:10.480
That is true.

32:14.080 --> 32:15.080
Have you found Di Lu?

32:16.320 --> 32:17.320
No.

32:19.000 --> 32:21.240
I checked everyone you told me

32:22.120 --> 32:23.240
to look into.

32:25.000 --> 32:26.760
Nothing seemed off.

32:30.680 --> 32:32.120
If you still don't trust them,

32:32.640 --> 32:34.000
I can kill them all.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.800
I don't have the patience

32:38.880 --> 32:40.400
to question every one of them.

32:42.080 --> 32:42.920
Don't kill them.

32:43.440 --> 32:45.000
We need every man we have right now.

32:48.720 --> 32:50.080
I'm going away for two days

32:51.320 --> 32:52.360
to take care

32:54.640 --> 32:55.880
of something important.

32:58.800 --> 33:00.080
Do what you must.

33:03.080 --> 33:04.320
It's chilly at night.

33:04.880 --> 33:06.080
Keep yourself warm.

34:10.040 --> 34:11.199
Hey.

34:11.280 --> 34:12.360
Are you all right?

34:34.199 --> 34:37.000
Ungrateful mutt, you're courting death!

35:09.120 --> 35:10.080
Don't run!

35:10.920 --> 35:12.440
Can you stop chasing me?

35:13.480 --> 35:15.080
Stop running! Stand still!

35:31.240 --> 35:32.320
This is bad.

35:37.120 --> 35:38.160
Don't run!

35:40.000 --> 35:41.720
Stop right there!

35:44.080 --> 35:45.080
Got you.

35:48.360 --> 35:50.680
So you made me eat like a dog, huh?

35:57.760 --> 35:59.720
And you thought you could outrun me?

36:05.000 --> 36:07.120
Which one of us looks more like a dog now?

36:23.160 --> 36:24.560
I didn't want to kill anyone.

36:24.640 --> 36:26.560
I'll ask you one last time.

36:26.640 --> 36:28.720
Do you have to go

36:28.800 --> 36:30.600
-into Hidden Soldier Alley?
-Yes.

36:32.640 --> 36:33.960
Is the Huben Army

36:34.480 --> 36:36.400
really worth all this?

36:37.120 --> 36:39.080
I have to die.

36:39.160 --> 36:40.160
If you go in,

36:40.760 --> 36:42.640
my master dies.

36:42.720 --> 36:44.280
I was sent to the north

36:44.360 --> 36:45.800
and stayed there for three years.

36:45.880 --> 36:47.360
I have a wife

36:48.280 --> 36:49.600
and a six-year-old daughter.

36:49.680 --> 36:52.240
The neighbors all thought
the man of the house had died.

36:52.760 --> 36:55.080
A rogue at the alley entrance

36:56.320 --> 36:58.480
set his sights on my wife.

36:58.560 --> 37:00.960
I have to go back and kill him myself.

37:03.000 --> 37:05.480
At the entrance
of Wazi Alley in Guiyi Ward,

37:07.400 --> 37:09.240
there's a breakfast stall.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.560
My wife

37:12.080 --> 37:15.680
often wears a worn-out purple robe.

37:19.000 --> 37:20.560
Go see for yourself.

38:37.280 --> 38:39.720
Your courtyard is quiet today.

38:41.840 --> 38:42.720
Sit.

38:48.320 --> 38:49.880
In the next few days,

38:50.400 --> 38:52.040
I need to issue
confidential travel passes.

38:53.520 --> 38:54.960
Wang Pu sent word

38:55.040 --> 38:56.880
to keep the handlers to a minimum,

38:58.440 --> 39:00.280
so I sent my helpers home.

39:01.200 --> 39:03.760
So it seems you are no longer suspected.

39:04.960 --> 39:05.800
Right.

39:06.440 --> 39:09.240
What are they treating
as such a grave matter?

39:16.480 --> 39:18.200
PHYSICAL DESCRIPTION

39:20.120 --> 39:21.560
"Height six chi."

39:22.600 --> 39:24.960
"Square forehead, broad face,
a nose rising straight to the brow,

39:25.560 --> 39:27.120
and long hanging earlobes."

39:27.200 --> 39:29.720
"From Binning to Chang'an."

39:30.960 --> 39:31.960
Is this describing

39:32.920 --> 39:33.760
Yan…
